### ==================== AUTH ====================

### Login as seeded admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@compoundresearch.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Register a new Research User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "researcher1@compoundresearch.local",
  "fullName": "Research User One",
  "password": "Research@123"
}

### ==================== COMPOUNDS ====================

### Search / list all compounds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/compounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search compounds by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/compounds?name=Metformin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single compound by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/compounds/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new compound (Draft status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sildenafil",
  "synonym": "Viagra",
  "description": "PDE5 inhibitor used for erectile dysfunction and pulmonary hypertension.",
  "molecularFormula": "C22H30N6O4S",
  "categoryId": null,
  "targetIds": []
}

### Review (approve) a compound - Reviewer/Admin only
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compounds/4/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": true,
  "comments": "Looks good, approved."
}

### ==================== QUERY (RAG) ====================

### Ask a question - normal case
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/query/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How does Metformin lower blood sugar?"
}

### Ask a question - edge case (no matching evidence expected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/query/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the melting point of unobtainium-42?"
}

### ==================== USERS (Admin only) ====================

### List all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===Document===
### Upload document - Metformin mechanism notes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="metformin_mechanism.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./metformin_mechanism.txt
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Title"

Metformin Mechanism Notes
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RelatedCompoundId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### DELETE
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


